  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency response to most at risk older people and their caregivers/families in Gaza to over come the psychological and social consequences of ongoing COVID pandemic and the recent hostilities.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support and enhance coping strategies and resilience of most at risk older people and their families to manage their situation and protect themselves from COVID-19</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support and enhance the health and psychological wellbeing of most at risk older people and their families</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
